固定平行語境辨識；原稱保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang:unit017:m0761","start":761,"end":762,"surface":"誕","kind":"person","person_id":"655_392_7f8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本完整敘事與固定平行語境辨識；原稱保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang:unit017:m0767","start":767,"end":769,"surface":"孫臏","kind":"person","person_id":"99a_9ca_6fi","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本完整敘事與固定平行語境辨識；原稱保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang:unit017:m0818","start":818,"end":819,"surface":"渾","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本完整敘事與固定平行語境辨識；原稱保留。"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-027-wangchang","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-027","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-027-wangchang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05","text":"孝公既沒，惠王、武王蒙故業，因遺冊，南兼漢中，西舉巴、蜀，東割膏腴之地，收要害之郡。諸侯恐懼，會盟而謀弱秦，不愛珍器重寶肥美之地，以致天下之士，合從締交，相與為一。當是時，齊有孟嘗，趙有平原，楚有春申，魏有信陵。此四君者，皆明知而忠信，寬厚而愛人，尊賢重士，約從離衡，并韓、魏、燕、楚、齊、趙、宋、衛、中山之眾。於是六國之士有寧越、徐尚、蘇秦、杜赫之屬為之謀，齊明、周最、陳軫、昭滑、樓緩、翟景、蘇厲、樂毅之徒通其意，吳起、孫臏、帶佗、兒良、王廖、田忌、廉頗、趙奢之朋制其兵。常以十倍之地，百萬之眾，叩關而攻秦。秦人開關延敵，九國之師逡巡遁逃而不敢進。秦無亡矢遺鏃之費，而天下諸侯已困矣。於是從散約解，爭割地而奉秦。秦有餘力而制其敝，追亡逐北，伏尸百萬，流血漂櫓。因利乘便，宰割天下，分裂河山，彊國請服，弱國入朝。延及孝文王、莊襄王，享國日淺，國家無事。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"孟嘗","kind":"person","person_id":"7pl_s0g_rkh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006